            "author_association": "NONE",
            "body": "Still an issue with `nvim_win_set_cursor`:\n\nNVIM v0.13.0-dev-1617+g 11d2f7a1ca\n\n```\n<up> - as expected\n<up> - follow enabled?\n<up> - follow enabled?\n```\n\n```lua\nvim.keymap.set(\"n\", \"<up>\", function()\n  local next_pos = vim.pos.cursor(0)\n  next_pos.row = math.max(next_pos.row - 1, 1)\n  vim.cmd(\"norm! Q\")\n  vim.cmd(\"norm! 2q=\") -- for readability\n  vim.api.nvim_win_set_cursor(0, next_pos:to_cursor())\n  vim.cmd(\"norm! 1q=\")\nend)\n```\n\nThough `vim.cmd(\"norm! k\")` works as expected.",
